Z||000011||Philphine||08-12-2001||01:50 PM||||tuner lug nuts? that what they called the ones they sold me. i had to get them for my wheels. have to use a special key. the only thing is there's nothing special about the key (more or less a big hex/star type key). i've got sets on two cars and my keys and anyone elses keys that has them are interchangeable so you have to get some even more expensive locks if you want to feel more secure.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>SERENITY NOW!!!!||||reg||1
