Z||000013||sloth85GT||08-12-2001||08:35 PM||||There's nothing wrong with Eagles Stage-2GT, that's just a common misconception among the ignorant. They rims are $400 each for polished aluminum (which is what i have). I got mine for $210 each because I have connections.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Pretty sweet deal if you ask me.<P>And yes, tuner lugnuts, but they have like an allen key type key. Ordering them tomorrow.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif"> <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
