Z||000016||Stage-2GT||08-12-2001||10:52 PM||||  Never said that there was anything wrong with the wheels. As a matter of fact I really like them or I wouldn't have inquired about them. As for the cost, maybe you should view this, <A HREF="http://www.rim1.com/eagle3.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rim1.com/eagle3.htm</A>  That seems rather high per wheel, when you can get the whole set for that much. Don't appreciate the inference that I am ignorant. But we all have our opinions. My opinion is, if you paid that per wheel for an Eagle wheel (which are not bad) then you might want to reconsider who is ignorant.<P>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>PS- I like how the insults fly without provocation, just amazing.<P>------------------<BR>"If Hate Was Money, I Would Own The World"||||reg||12
