Z||000019||sloth85GT||08-13-2001||03:57 AM||||Stage-2GT, that was just a silly joke of mine, I didn't mean it, really.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Sorry that I put it the wrong way. <P>And as for cost and such of the wheels. There's SOOOOOOOOOOO many different kinds out there to choose from, and the reason I went with the Eagles is cause I know like 4 guys that work at Fountain Tire and I was able to get my tires and rims at cost price. The reason that I didn't want to go with 17's was because yeah, they cost a bit more, but so do the tires, I'd need like 40 series tires and I'd be paying a lot more. I'm 19 and my costs have to be right at the bottom, I can't spare the extra $100 or $200 so that's why I chose the 15s. They'll still look pretty damn sweet. <P>Once again to Stage-2GT, my apologies, didn't directly call you igorant, that's just me being silly.<P>Thanks for the responses so far eveyone, your input has been great. <P>I just can't wait to get these puppies on my car. I'm going tomorrow to order my nuts. Don't know how long that'll take. But I possibly won't have the wheels on my car until after I get back from Vancouver on the 28th.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif"> <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
